  "description": "Retail fit-out, combining two units into one across basement, ground, and first floors.\n\nUnit 245 \n245 Regent Street\nW1B 2EN London, UK\n\nUnit 247 \n247 Regent Street\nW1B 2EW London, UK\n\nThe demolition works that affect the original construction consists on the following:\n\n- entrance door and fixed glasses in Unit located in 245 Regent Street, which will be replaced by new ones in\ndifferent location within the openings left\n- previous tenants' signages on fascia and blade signs to be replaced and relocated by Skims logos\n\nSkims will also add a flag to the fascia at the corner.\n\nThe rest of the demolitions only affect elements that have been added later by different tenants, this is all the fit out which in summary includes the following:\n\n - Finishes, handrails and balustrade from existing stair\n- All the ramps\n- Flooring finishes\n- Suspended ceilings, lighting fittings\n- All internal partitions and linings as well as wall finishes\n- All fixtures\n - All back of house storage racks and furniture\n- All MEP and sprinklers equipment\n\nListed Building consent was granted on the base build of removal of the modern dividing wall and modern fixtures to amalgamate the two retail units into a single retail unit in January 2025, Application number: 24/08933/LBC"
}